+            KNIRVSERVER is the operator node in a decentralized trusted execution network. The
+            full stack — KNIRVCHAIN (IBC sovereign chain), KNIRVGATEWAY (P2P routing), oracle
+            service, NFT badge credentials, ICME semantic memory — is a coherent protocol, not
+            just a product. The pitch is a network flywheel: more operators → more validation
+            capacity → more trust → higher badge/token value → more operators.
+          </p>
+          <div class="pitch-box">
