+          <div class="pitch-box">
+            "Every major AI platform requires your data to leave your network. KNIRVSERVER
+            runs on your hardware, your keys never leave your vault, and every inference
+            stays inside your perimeter. The AI capabilities you need, without the data
+            sovereignty you can't afford to lose."
