+        </div>
+
+        <div class="strategy-section">
+          <h4>Target Buyers</h4>
+          <p>
+            Healthcare systems (HIPAA), legal (attorney-client privilege), financial services
+            (GLBA/PCI), defense/intelligence (ITAR/CUI), and EU-regulated companies (GDPR
+            data residency requirements). Buyer is <strong>CISO + IT procurement</strong>.
+            These buyers spend real money on software that keeps data on-premise — they already
+            budget for it.
+          </p>
