+
+        <div class="strategy-section">
+          <h4>Codebase Support</h4>
+          <p>
+            This angle is well-supported: Markdown Fabric encrypted memory service, HashiCorp
+            Vault integration, secret rotation service, local knowledge base GraphRAG queries,
+            per-DVE SSH access control, WASM sandboxed plugins (no native code execution),
+            BuntDB embedded (actually an advantage for air-gapped deployments), and the multi-model
+            inferencer with Cerebras/local model routing. The <code>KNIRV_JWT_SECRET</code>
+            environment variable pattern and production config's explicit database path suggest
