+              <li>BuntDB embedded store is actually an advantage for air-gapped environments</li>
+              <li>No external dependencies needed for core operation</li>
+              <li>Clear differentiation from cloud-only competitors (all of them)</li>
+              <li>GDPR/HIPAA compliance buyers have large, recurring budgets</li>
+              <li>eBPF on dedicated Linux hardware — no cloud container restrictions</li>
